WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Face a wall and place both hands on it at shoulder height.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Step one foot back and press that heel down.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the back leg mostly straight and the front knee soft.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lean gently until you feel the calf stretch.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
